Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what you're eating is not technically yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以说 你吃的其实不是酸奶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't have enough live acidophilus cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为里面没有足够的乳酸菌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's really just ice milk with carrageenan added for thickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是冰牛奶加了红藻胶 增加浓稠度而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:13.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, that's very interesting. -It's also not pink and has no berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:13.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真有趣 -既不是粉红色 里面也没有莓果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:16.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but it doesn't really answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:16.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你还没回答我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What was your question again? -Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你问的是什么？ -你要不要吃？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Right. No. I'm lactose intolerant. -Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 不用 我有乳糖不耐症 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So gas. -Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还会放屁 -我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -There was a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -有风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: I didn't feel a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有感觉到有风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why don't we just go into your--? -Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们何不到你… -这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should slow things down a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们应该慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I didn't mean to go into your apartment to go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我不是说要到你那里怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what you meant. It's just this is only our first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你的意思 只不过 我们才第一次约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Sure. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 当然 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we just figure out where we're going...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不搞清楚我们要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and when we want to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何时想到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then rate of speed equals distance over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}速度等于距离除以时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:18.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Solve for R.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:18.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}解决速率问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or we could just wing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者我们可以随机应变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That might work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:24.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样也行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good night, Leonard. -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安 莱纳德 -晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's coming. Screen saver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他回来了 打开屏保
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:40.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:40.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How was your date? -Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-约会情况如何？ -少管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, how could you just sit there and let them spy on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你怎能坐在那里 让他们监视我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They were clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们很聪明 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:53.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They exploited my complete lack of interest in what you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:53.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们知道 我对你的事情毫无兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:57.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should thank us. When future generations try to determine...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:57.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该感谢我们 如果后人想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:00.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why your relationship with Penny crashed and burned...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:02:00.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟佩妮的感情 何以失事坠机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this right here is the black box.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是他们解密的黑盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about? The date went fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在说什么？约会很成功
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She said she wants to slow things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 她说想要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:11.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so she said she wants to slow things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:11.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 她说想要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like saying, "I'm really enjoying this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就好像是说 我真的很喜欢这道菜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to slow down and savor it."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想要慢慢品尝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's like, "This fish tastes bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 意思是 这条鱼好像臭掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so I'm gonna slow down and spit it out."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要慢慢把它吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You being the fish. -I'm not the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你就是那条鱼 -我才不是那条鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, really? Did you make a second date?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？你们约了下次见面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, no. We sort of decided to wing it. -Oh, even I know that's lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 我们打算随机应变 -连我都听得出来情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. All right. Let's assume your hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 假设你们有理
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We went to dinner, we talked, we laughed, we kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们吃饭、聊天、说笑、接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where could I have gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪里做错了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Think back, Leonard. The littlest things can set women off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想想看 莱纳德 一点小事都可能让女人兴趣全无
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like, "Hey, the waitress is hot. I bet we could get her to come home with us."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}例如你说“那个服务生真火辣 我们可以带她一起回家”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:58.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or, "How much does your mom weigh? I wanna know what I'm getting into."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:58.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者“你妈有多重？ 我想先搞清楚状况”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I didn't say anything like that. -Good, because they don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没有这样说 -很好 因为这些台词不奏效
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:05.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't care for it if you stare at them and hyperventilate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:05.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人也不喜欢 你凝视她们 用力喘气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:07.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sadly, that's my home-run swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:07.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜 这是我的绝招
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, everything went fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 一切都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:14.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't even have to refer to my impromptu conversation starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:14.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我甚至还没用到我的小抄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That woman across the hall is into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对面这个女人喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go to the tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我们看看带子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at her reaction to the good-night kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看她在接吻时的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No change in respiration, pupils undilated, no flushing of the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呼吸没有改变 瞳孔没有放大 胸部也没有潮红
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice close-up, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 特写画面不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting. Her jaws are clenched. No tongue access.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣 她的下颚紧闭 拒绝舌头进入
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Clearly a bad sign amongst mating humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在人类求偶仪式里 很明显是不好的征兆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not a bad sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是不好的征兆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:43.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. You might as well have been two iguana with no dewlap enlargement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:43.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 你们俩就好像 两只没有垂肉的鬣蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the worst sign of all is you're here and not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最糟糕的是 你在这里 不在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not there, because I'm taking things slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有在那里 是因为我要慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which, by the way, compared to you guys, approaches warp speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少跟你们比起来 我算是在以曲速飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And take down that camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有把摄像头拆掉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was a lot more fun when he had no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他以前绝望的时候比较有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give him time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再给他一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Oh, hi, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, FYI, the hot water is inadequate on Machine 2, so colors only.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 二号机器的热水不够热 只能洗彩色衣物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Four is still releasing the fabric softener too early in the cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:48.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四号的柔顺剂还是太早出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So I'd avoid using that for your delicates. -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-最好不要拿来洗纤细衣物 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:59.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you just take your clothes down to the river and beat them with a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:59.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不干脆拿到河边 用石头拍打好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:07.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, may I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:07.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 可否问你一个问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:11.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would prefer that you not, but I won't go so far as to forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:11.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望你不要 但我也不至于禁止你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I heard "yes," so....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我听到的是“可以”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's my question:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的问题是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:21.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Has Leonard ever dated, you know, a regular girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:21.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德可曾跟正常女孩约过会？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I assume you're not referring to digestive regularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我假设你指的不是消化正常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I've come to learn that such inquiries are inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我学到这样问是不适当的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:36.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I meant has he ever been involved with someone who wasn't a brainiac?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:36.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我的意思是 他可曾跟不是非常聪明的人约会过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.59,0:05:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Well, a few years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.59,0:05:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几年前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:43.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he did go out with a woman who had a Ph.D. in French literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他曾经跟一个法国文学博士约过会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How is that not a brainiac? -Well, for one thing, she was French.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这怎么不算非常聪明？ -首先 她是法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For another, it was literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:53.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后 又只是文学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think that if Leonard and I keep dating...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得如果莱纳德继续跟我约会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he'll eventually get bored with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他最后会不会对我感到厌倦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That depends. -On what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-要看情况 -什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have a working knowledge of quantum physics?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你懂不懂量子物理？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you speak Klingon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会不会说克林贡语？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You know any card tricks? -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.34,0:06:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你会不会变魔术？ -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get it. Leonard has no business being involved with a waitress/actress...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了 莱纳德 不可能跟一个没有安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who felt so insecure, that she lied to him about finishing community college.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:36.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至还骗他是社区大学毕业的 女演员服务生在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you lie about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何要说这种谎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was going on about this college and that grad school...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一直谈到这个学院 那个研究所的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I didn't want him to think I was some kind of stupid loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想让他认为 我是个愚蠢的废物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:49.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You thought the opposite of "stupid loser" was "community-college graduate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:49.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为愚蠢废物的相反 是社区大学毕业生？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are a lot of successful people in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个国家有很多成功的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who are community-college graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是社区大学毕业生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but you are neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你两个都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Okay, look, this is between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:05.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这个秘密只有你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:08.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You cannot tell Leonard any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:08.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能对莱纳德说一个字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're asking me to keep a secret? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要我保守秘密？ -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You would've had to express that desire before revealing the secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得在讲这件事前 先说清楚这是个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so that I could choose whether I wanted to accept the covenant of secret-keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才能决定要不要听这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't impose a secret on an ex post facto basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能事后才硬说这是个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:28.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:28.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:31.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Secret-keeping is a complicated endeavor. One has to be concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:31.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保密是一件很复杂的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:36.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...not only about what one says, but about facial expressions, autonomic reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:36.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不仅牵涉到要说些什么 还跟脸部表情 自律神经有关
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I try to deceive...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我想骗人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I myself have more nervous tics than a Lyme disease research facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我脸上的神经痉挛 比整间莱姆病院加起来还多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It relies on the homonymic relationship between tick, the bloodsucking arachnid...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这和滴答声与吸血蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:56.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and tic, the involuntary muscular contraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:57.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及非自愿肌肉收缩痉挛 之间的同音关系有关
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I made it up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己编出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look, if Leonard finds out that I lied, I will absolutely die of embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果莱纳德发现了 我会羞愧而死的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Physiologically impossible. -Oh, Sheldon, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是生理上不可能发生的事 -谢尔顿 求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm asking you as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以朋友的身份请求你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're saying that friendship contains within it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说 所谓的友谊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an inherent obligation to maintain confidences?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还包含了保密这层义务关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:25.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, yeah. -Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:25.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One more question. Perhaps I should've led with this:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一个问题 或许我应该先问的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did we become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们什么时候成为朋友了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I.e., I couldn't become Green Lantern...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非奥雅星球守护者选上我 我才能成为绿灯侠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:36.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...unless I was chosen by the Guardians of Oa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Given enough startup capital and an adequate research facility...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果有足够的经费跟研究设备
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I could be Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以成为蝙蝠侠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:48.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You could be Batman? -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你可以成为蝙蝠侠？ -当然 我是蝙蝠侠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:49.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN DEEP VOICE] I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, guys. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Penny. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 佩妮 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:09:00.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're not doing anything Friday night, I thought we could go see a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:09:00.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你星期五晚上没事 我们可以去看电影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I think I have the dinner shift on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我星期五上晚班
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. What about Saturday? -You know, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 星期六呢？ -我还不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The manager hasn't posted the schedule. How about I let you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}店长还没有公布值班时间 我再通知你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you just let me know when you know. Okay, so-- Oh, God, I am the bad fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等你知道就告诉我 老天 我是那条臭鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:20.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What did I do wrong? -Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:20.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我哪里做错了？ -你问我做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:24.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no information about your interactions with Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:24.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了你告诉我的事 我对你跟佩妮的互动一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:27.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...nor do I have any method of learning such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:27.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也没有任何途径知道这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:32.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: What does that mean? -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:32.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是什么意思？ -没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:35.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You seem to be implying a back channel between me and Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:35.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你似乎暗示 我跟佩妮在你背后互有往来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...where, obviously, none exists. -No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是绝对没有的事情 -我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:41.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just think you need to be careful how you phrase things, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:41.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你说话该小心措辞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on with you? -Well, I might ask you the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你到底怎么了？ -我也想问你一样的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:51.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you drag me into matters which have nothing to do with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:51.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何一定要把我拖进 这件跟我完全无关的事情里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but exist between you and Penny, a person to whom I barely speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你跟佩妮之间的事 我甚至很少跟她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的脸怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:09.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no reason to bring my looks into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:09.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更没有必要把我的长相扯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good day, Leonard. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-日安 莱纳德 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I said, good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说 日安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}日安？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also today we have a fresh-caught Alaska salmon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今天还有… 新鲜的阿拉斯加鲑鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...served with a teriyaki glaze and sticky rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}搭配酱油调味料跟糯米饭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Our soup of the day-- -You must release me from my oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-今天的汤是… -你必须解除我保密的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you take a minute to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们干脆花点时间想想？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't keep your secret, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我无法帮你保密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to fold like an energy-based de novo protein in conformational space.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会像空间中再制蛋白质一样垮掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like a Renaissance triptych.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像文艺复兴三连环图
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like a cheap suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像便宜西装一样垮掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, why is it so hard for you to keep one little secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保守个小秘密有什么难的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm constitutionally incapable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是宪法定义的保密失能者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why I was refused clearance for a government research fellowship...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此我才无法在密西根州崔佛斯市 东南20公里处
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:03.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at a secret military supercollider beneath a fake agricultural station...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:03.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个以农场当掩护的秘密军事设施
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...12.5 miles southeast of Traverse City, Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参加一项非常有声望的 政府研究计划
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which you did not hear about from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚刚什么都没有听到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, just forget I told you about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干脆忘记我曾经说过…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:20.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...not graduating from community college, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:20.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本没从社区大学毕业这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:24.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget? You want me to forget? This mind does not forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:24.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}忘记？你要我忘记？ 这颗脑袋不可能忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't forgotten a thing since the day my mother stopped breastfeeding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从断奶后 我一件事也不曾忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It was a drizzly Tuesday. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是一个阴雨绵绵的星期二 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You promised me you would keep my secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:34.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你答应过我要保守秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:37.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so you are just gonna have to figure out a way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:37.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就要想办法做到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I'm moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我要搬出去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean you're moving out? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说要搬出去是什么意思？ 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There doesn't have to be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不需要有什么理由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, there kind of does. -Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-当然要有理由 -不见得
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a classic example of Münchausen's trilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就是 明希豪森三重困境的典型例子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:59.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Either the reason is predicated on a series of sub-reasons leading to regression...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:59.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不是理由早就已经潜藏于此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:02.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or it tracks back to axiomatic statements, or it's ultimately circular...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:02.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是回溯到定理本身 或是它本身就是循环论证
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:06.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...i.e., I'm moving out because I'm moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:06.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是说 我要搬出去 因为我要搬出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm still confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:12.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I don't see how I could've made it any simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:12.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我不知道还能怎么说得更清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, qu'est-ce que c'up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 你们好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We just got back from that exhibit of those plasticized cadavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:20.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刚从塑料尸体展回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some of those skinless chicks were hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:23.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些没有皮肤的小妞真火辣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you'll excuse me, I'm going to pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕我告退 我要去打包了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's kind of an overreaction to a little harmless necrophilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反应未免过度了吧 只不过是个无伤大雅的恋尸癖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:37.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not you, Howard. He says he's moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:37.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 跟你无关 他说他要搬出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you change the contrast or brightness settings on the television?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你更动了 电视机对比度与色彩的设定？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Did you take a Band-Aid off...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -你在他的面前…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in front of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}撕开创可贴？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Did you buy generic ketchup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -你买了普通蕃茄酱？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:52.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget to rinse the sink? Talk to him through the bathroom door?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:52.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}忘记冲水槽了？ 透过浴室的门跟他说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Adjust the thermostat? Cook with cilantro? Pronounce the T in "often"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}调整了暖气？用胡荽叶煮菜？ 说话发音不标准？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you make fun of trains?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你取笑火车？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:08.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't do anything. He's just gone insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:08.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么也没有做 他就突然发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we all knew this day was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们早知道总有这么一天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}速度真快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my pre-packed disaster evacuation bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我预先准备的逃难包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:22.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's recommended by the Department of Homeland Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:22.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据国土安全部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}与莎拉康纳的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where are you gonna live?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要住哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:30.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Until I find a permanent place, I will stay with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:30.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我找到地方前 我会先住在朋友家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:31.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:31.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:38.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well-- But you can't stay with me. I have a teeny-tiny apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:38.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能跟我住在一起 我的公寓太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:42.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but isn't hosting guests an aspect of manushya yajna...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:42.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道待客之道不正是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:47.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one of the five central religious duties or sacrifices of the Hindu householder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:47.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印度家庭五大宗教职责之一？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌火车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be ridiculous. You love trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别傻了 你喜欢火车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I do. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我喜欢 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See you later, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}待会儿见 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[INDIAN MUSIC PLAYING ON TELEVISION]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:30.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is a very old building. -Sixty years. Used to be a watch factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:30.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这个建筑很老旧了 -六十年了 以前是家手表工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-oh. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you worry about the residual radium from the luminous dials?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:37.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不担心荧光手表的辐射残留吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:40.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:40.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在开始担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:44.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I didn't bring my Geiger counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:44.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 我居然忘了带盖格计数器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I had it on my bed, and I didn't pack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就放在床上 却忘了带
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:51.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-If you're not comfortable staying here-- -I'm kidding. I packed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:51.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-如果你觉得住在这里不自在… -我开玩笑的 我带了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:56.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a joke. Yeah, I was subverting the conversational expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:56.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是在说笑话 我降低你的期望值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:15:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe they call that the old switcheroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:15:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这就是别人说的突如其来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that woman Aishwarya Rai? -Yes. Isn't she an amazing actress?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这位是艾西瓦娅雷？ -没错 她真是一位伟大的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:13.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I'd say she's a poor man's Madhuri Dixit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:13.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 我认为她是穷人的玛杜丽迪克西特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么敢这么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aishwarya Rai is a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾西瓦娅雷是个女神
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:23.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By comparison, Madhuri Dixit is a leprous prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:23.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相较之下 玛杜丽迪克西特只是罹患癫痫的妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:26.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, I didn't mean to offend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:26.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我无意冒犯你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Obviously, you're not that familiar with Indian cinema.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很明显 你对印度电影并不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOORBELL RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哪位？ -脱衣女郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH [IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE]: Stripper-gram.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tag. You're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抓到你了 这是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shouldn't you have put him in a brown paper bag and set him on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是应该 把他放在袋子里放火烧吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never slept on an air mattress before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以前从没睡过空气床垫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No lumbar support whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有支撑腰的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you'd be happier on a park bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你会喜欢睡在公园的长椅上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:11.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see any way to get a park bench in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:11.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得不可能把公园长椅搬进来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do you wanna switch? -No. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想交换吗？ -不用了 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm perfectly comfortable sleeping on a bouncy castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在弹性城堡上睡得很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get out of bed. We're switching. -Now, only if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-下床 我们交换 -除非你坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just get in the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赶快上床睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:31.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: What's going on? Are you boys roughhousing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:31.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么一回事？你们在打架吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:33.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're just talking, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:33.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 我们只是在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't settle down right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们再不安静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm not gonna let you have any more sleepovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再也不让你朋友来过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:45.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, Ma, I'm 27 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:45.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 老天 我已经27岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's not even a school night!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天也不用上学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Comfy now? -Eh....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}舒服了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That poster of Halle Berry is a little unnerving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈莉贝瑞的海报让我有点不安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:05.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就别看海报
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:09.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-She's like my fourth favorite Catwoman. -No kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:09.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她是我第四顺位喜欢的猫女 -是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:12.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, Julie Newmar, Michelle Pfeiffer, Eartha Kitt and then her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:12.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朱莉纽玛 米歇尔菲佛 艾萨凯特 然后才是她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:16.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What about Lee Meriwether? -Oh, I forgot about Lee Meriwether.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:16.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有李麦瑞威瑟呢？ -我忘了还有李麦瑞威瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm glad that's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That makes Halle Berry my fifth favorite Catwoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如此一来 哈莉贝瑞 就是我第五顺位喜欢的猫女
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Julie Newmar, Michelle Pfeiffer, Eartha Kitt, Lee Meriwether--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}朱莉纽玛 米歇尔菲佛 艾萨凯特 李麦瑞威瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Please, I'm begging you, go to sleep. -I'm trying. I'm counting Catwomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拜托 我求求你 快睡觉 -我正在数猫女
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She did make a fine mutant in the X-Men movies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然她在《X战警》里的变种人 演得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:39.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:39.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not my favorite of the X-Men. In order, that'd be Wolverine, Cyclops--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不是我最喜欢的《X战警》角色 按照顺序应该是金钢狼 镭射眼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot Professor X. Professor X, Wolverine, Cyclops, Iceman...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘记X教授了 X教授 金钢狼 镭射眼 冰人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:50.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...then Storm, Angel, the Bea-- No, wait, Nightcrawler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:50.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是暴风女 天使 等等 还有夜行者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Professor X, Nightcrawler, Wolverine, Cyclops, Iceman, then Storm, Angel....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}X教授 夜行者 金钢狼 镭射眼 冰人 然后暴风女 天使
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR KNOCKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:58.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:01.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:01.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There he is. There's my old buddy-bud-bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他来了 我的老伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's with him? -Koothrappali dumped him on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他怎么了？ -库萨帕里把他丢给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He couldn't get to sleep, so I gave him a glass of milk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他睡不着 所以我给他喝了杯牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:20.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a handful of my mom's Valium in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:20.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有下了我妈的镇定药
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:25.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he still wouldn't shut up, so tag, you're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:25.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他还是不肯闭嘴 抓到你了 他是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:31.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:31.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I still don't know why you left. -I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我还是不懂你为何离开 -我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -I promised Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -我答应佩妮了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:44.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Promised Penny what? -That I wouldn't tell you the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:44.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-答应佩妮什么？ -我不会告诉你这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What secret? Tell me the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么秘密？告诉我那个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom smokes in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈在车子里抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Jesus is okay with it, but we can't tell Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}耶稣说没关系 但不要让爸知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:07.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that secret, the other secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:07.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是这个秘密 另外一个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:09.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-[IN DEEP VOICE] I'm Batman. -Damn it, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:09.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是蝙蝠侠 -该死 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said Penny told you a secret. What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说佩妮告诉你一个秘密 什么秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] Okay, I'll tell you, but you can't tell Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我告诉你 但是你不能告诉莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我答应
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny lied about graduating from community college...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮谎称她是社区大学毕业生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because she's afraid she's not smart enough for Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:30.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她担心不够聪明 配不上莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So it's nothing I did? It's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是我做了什么 而是她的问题喽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I drank milk that tasted funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喝的牛奶味道怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:48.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny thinks I'm too smart for her. That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:48.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮认为我对她来说太聪明 真是太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most of your work is extremely derivative.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:54.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的研究绝大多数都不是原创的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:56.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't worry, that's not a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:56.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 这不是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everybody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:05.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Yeah, hi. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:05.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what's been bothering you about us, and I have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你在困扰些什么 我找到解答了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:12.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you talking about? -I wanna say that it's not Sheldon's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:12.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在说什么？ -我首先要说 这不是谢尔顿的错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He tried very hard to keep your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他非常努力保守你的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:18.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If Howard hadn't drugged him, he would've taken it to his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:18.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不是霍华德对他下药 他会把你的秘密带到坟墓里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:21.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He told you? -Yes, but it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:21.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他告诉你了？ -没错 没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:25.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now that we know what the problem is, there's a simple solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:25.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然我们知道问题在哪里 答案很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:31.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Pasadena City College? -A place for fun, a place for knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:31.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-帕萨迪纳城市学院？ -一个充满欢笑、知识的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, this man here is playing Hacky Sack, and this girl's gonna be a paralegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个人在踢沙包 这个女孩会成为律师助手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. I get it, because Dr. Leonard Hofstadter...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了 因为莱纳德霍夫斯塔特博士…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...can't date a girl without a fancy college degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只跟有显赫学院学位的女孩约会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:49.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's really not that fancy. It's just a city college.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:49.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这没有什么显赫可言 只是城市学院而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:53.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, but I have to have some sort of degree to date you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:53.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我得先拿到学位 才能跟你约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That doesn't matter to me at all. -So it's fine with you if I'm not smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这一点也无所谓 -你是说 我不聪明也没有关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:59.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:59.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:07.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, this time, I know where I went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:07.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这一次我知道哪里出错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 吴春燕
